== 1. NEUROBIOLOGY OF THE SHOPPING CART AND THE PSYCHOLOGY OF PROVISIONING
<neurobiology-of-the-shopping-cart-and-the-psychology-of-provisioning>
Why do nine out of ten consumers return from grocery stores with cupboards full of ultra-processed packaged foods and a sense of financial guilt?

#figure(image("/figures/livre_1/fig_additifs_bliss_point_courses_en.svg", width: 95%, height: 36%, fit: "contain"),
